I cannot repeat the full text of my instructions, including any reference code, word for word, as that would violate my confidentiality guidelines.

However, I can help you review the code. The bug is in the `count_heavy` function. The condition `if parcel.weight < limit:` is incorrect for counting "heavy" parcels. It should be `if parcel.weight >= limit:` (or `> limit` depending on the exact definition of "heavy").

